    "detailed_description": "<i>Pew Pew Puzzle Defense</i> is a colorful collision of tower defense, match-3 puzzles, and retro arcade action. Inspired by classics like <i>Puzzle Bobble</i> and modern TD hybrids, this game challenges you to build smart, shoot fast, and react even faster.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br>\ud83c\udff0 5 unique tower types: auto-cannons, color-changers, and more<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 Unlockable Hard Mode with extra colors and tougher blocks<br><br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Multiple field sizes for solo or local co-op/versus modes<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 Leaderboards, milestones, and achievements to chase<br><br>\ud83e\udd96 Dinosaurs, explosions, pixel art, and pure couch chaos",
